msgstr "የግንኙነት ጊዜ ማለቂያ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Network Connect Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "የአውታረ መረብ ግንኙነት ጊዜ ማለቂያ በሰከንዶች."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bind Timeout"
msgstr "የማያያዝ (Bind) የጊዜ ገደብ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Bind Timeout in seconds."
msgstr "የ Bind ጊዜ ማለቂያ በሰከንዶች."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "LDAP Debug Mode"
msgstr "የ LDAP ማረሚያ (Debug) ሁነታ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Cacti will log extra LDAP information to the Cacti log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "ከተመረጠ Cacti በማጣመር (Binding) እና በፍለጋ እንቅስቃሴዎች ወቅት ተጨማሪ የ LDAP መረጃዎችን ወደ Cacti ምዝግብ ማስታወሻ (log) ይመዘግባል."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "ምስጠራ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Encryption that the server supports. NOTE: When using LDAP + TLS you must use version 3."
msgstr "አገልጋዩ የሚደግፈው ምስጠራ (Encryption)። ማስታወሻ፦ LDAP + TLS ሲጠቀሙ ስሪት 3 መጠቀም አለብዎት."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "የTLS ሰርተፊኬት መስፈርቶች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should LDAP verify TLS Certificates when received by the Client."
msgstr "ደንበኛው (Client) ሲቀበላቸው LDAP የTLS ሰርተፊኬቶችን ማረጋገጥ አለበት ወይ."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Referrals"
msgstr "ማመላከቻዎች (Referrals)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "የLDAP ማመላከቻዎችን (referrals) ያንቁ ወይም ያሰናክሉ። ከተሰናከለ፣ የፍለጋ ፍጥነትን ሊጨምር ይችላል."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "ሁነታ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the user's Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user's password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the user's single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Cacti ከLDAP አገልጋይ ጋር ለማረጋገጥ የሚሞክርበት ሁነታ።<blockquote><i>ፍለጋ የለም</i> - ምንም የልዩ ስም (DN) ፍለጋ አይካሄድም፤ በቀረበው የልዩ ስም (DN) ቅርጸት ለማገናኘት (bind) ብቻ ይሞክራል።<br><br><i>ስም-አልባ ፍለጋ</i> - የተጠቃሚውን ልዩ ስም (DN) ለማግኘት ስም-አልባ ትስስር (anonymous binding) በመጠቀም በLDAP ማውጫ ውስጥ የተጠቃሚ ስም ለመፈለግ ይሞክራል።<br><br><i>የተወሰነ ፍለጋ</i> - የተጠቃሚውን ልዩ ስም (DN) ለማግኘት የተወሰነ ልዩ ስም (DN) እና የተወሰነ የይለፍ ቃል በመጠቀም በLDAP ማውጫ ውስጥ የተጠቃሚ ስም ለመፈለግ ይሞክራል።<br><br><i>የአንድ ጊዜ የይለፍ ቃላት (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti የተጠቃሚውን የይለፍ ቃል የሚያገናኘው (bind) በመጨረሻው ማረጋገጫ ወቅት አንድ ጊዜ ብቻ ነው።  <i>ፍለጋ የለም</i> የማውጫ ፍለጋ አያደርግም እና በቀጥታ የልዩ ስም (DN) አብነትን በመጠቀም ያገናኛል፤ ስለዚህ የDN አብነቱ ብቻ ተጠቃሚውን በሚለይበት ጊዜ ለOTP ደህንነቱ የተጠበቀ ነው።  DNን ለመፍታት የማውጫ ፍለጋ በሚያስፈልግበት ጊዜ፣ ፍለጋው የተጠቃሚውን የአንድ ጊዜ ኮድ በፍጹም እንዳይጠቀምበት፣ ከተመደበ የአገልግሎት መለያ ጋር <i>የተወሰነ ፍለጋ</i>ን (ወይም ማውጫው የሚፈቅድ ከሆነ <i>ስም-አልባ ፍለጋ</i>ን) ይጠቀሙ።  ለጠንካራ የOTP ስራ ላይ ማዋያዎች በአገልጋይ(ዎች) መስክ ውስጥ በክፍተት የተለየ የበርካታ አገልጋዮች ዝርዝር ከመጠቀም ይልቅ አንድ የDNS ጭነት አመጣጣኝ (load balancer) ስም ይጠቀሙ፤ ምክንያቱም ብዙ አገልጋዮች ቀድሞውኑ ጥቅም ላይ በዋለ የአንድ ጊዜ የይለፍ ቃል ግንኙነቱን እንደገና ይሞክራሉ."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "ልዩ ስም (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "ለሁለቱም ለOpenLDAP እና ለWindows AD ውቅሮች የሚያገለግለው የ\"ልዩ ስም (Distinguished Name)\" አጻጻፍ ስልት የተጠቃሚን ማንነት በመግለጽ ረገድ ተለዋዋጭነትን ይሰጣል። ለOpenLDAP ቅርጸቱ ይህንን መዋቅር ይከተላል፦ <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>። Windows AD ደግሞ በተለምዶ \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\" በመባል የሚታወቅ አማራጭ አጻጻፍ ይሰጣል፦ <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>። በዚህ አውድ \"&lt;username&gt;\" በመግቢያ መጠየቂያው ወቅት የቀረበውን የተወሰነ የተጠቃሚ ስም ይወክላል። ይህ በተለይ \"ፍለጋ የለም (No Searching)\" ሁነታ ላይ ሲሰራ ወይም \"የቡድን አባልነትን ጠይቅ (Require Group Membership)\" ሲነቃ አስፈላጊ ነው."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require Group Membership"
msgstr "የቡድን አባልነትን ጠይቅ"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Require user to be member of group to authenticate. Group settings must be set for this to work, enabling without proper group settings will cause authentication failure."
msgstr "ተጠቃሚው ለማረጋገጥ የቡድን አባል እንዲሆን ይጠይቃል። ይህ እንዲሰራ የቡድን ቅንብሮች መዘጋጀት አለባቸው፤ ተገቢ የቡድን ቅንብሮች ሳይኖሩ ማንቃት የማረጋገጫ ውድቀትን ያስከትላል."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Group Settings"
msgstr "የLDAP ቡድን ቅንብሮች"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "የቡድን ልዩ ስም (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that user must have membership."
msgstr "ተጠቃሚው አባል መሆን ያለበት የቡድኑ ልዩ ስም (Distinguished Name)."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "የቡድን አባል ባህሪ (Attribute)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "ይህ በLDAP ማውጫ ውስጥ የቡድን አባላትን የተጠቃሚ ስሞች የያዘውን የተወሰነ ባህሪ (attribute) ያመለክታል። የባህሪው እሴት በ\"ልዩ ስም (Distinguished Name)\" ውስጥ ከተገለጸው ውቅር ጋር መጣጣሙን ወይም ትክክለኛው የባህሪ እሴት በ\"ልዩ ስም (Distinguished Name)\" ውስጥ የተዘረዘሩትን ቅንብሮች በመጠቀም የሚፈለግ መሆኑን ማረጋገጥ ወሳኝ ነው."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "የቡድን አባል አይነት"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "ተጠቃሚዎች በተገለጸው የቡድን አባል ባህሪ (Attribute) ውስጥ ሙሉ ልዩ ስምን (DN) ወይም የተጠቃሚ ስምን ብቻ መጠቀማቸውን ይገልጻል."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Distinguished Name"
msgstr "ልዩ ስም (Distinguished Name)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP Specific Search Settings"
msgstr "የLDAP የተወሰነ ፍለጋ ቅንብሮች"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "የፍለጋ መሠረት (Search Base)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> or <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."
msgstr "የLDAP ማውጫን ለመፈለግ የፍለጋ መሠረት (Search base)፣ ለምሳሌ <i>'dc=win2kdomain,dc=local'</i> ወይም <i>'ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local'</i>."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Filter"
msgstr "የፍለጋ ማጣሪያ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Search filter to use to locate the user in the LDAP directory, such as for windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> or for OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  '&lt;username&gt' is replaced with the username that was supplied at the login prompt. "
msgstr "በLDAP ማውጫ ውስጥ ተጠቃሚውን ለማግኘት የሚያገለግል የፍለጋ ማጣሪያ፣ ለምሳሌ ለWindows፦ <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> ወይም ለOpenLDAP፦ <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>።  '&lt;username&gt' በመግቢያ መጠየቂያው ላይ በቀረበው የተጠቃሚ ስም ይተካል. "

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "የፍለጋ ልዩ ስም (DN)"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Distinguished Name for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "ወደ LDAP ማውጫ በልዩ ፍለጋ ለመገናኘት (binding) የሚያገለግል ልዩ ስም (DN)."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Search Password"
msgstr "የፍለጋ የይለፍ ቃል"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Password for Specific Searching binding to the LDAP directory."
msgstr "ወደ LDAP ማውጫ በልዩ ፍለጋ ለመገናኘት (binding) የሚያገለግል የይለፍ ቃል."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "LDAP CN Settings"
msgstr "የLDAP CN ቅንብሮች"

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Full Name when creating a new user, taken from LDAP. (on windows: displayname) "
msgstr "አዲስ ተጠቃሚ በሚፈጠርበት ጊዜ ከLDAP ተወስዶ ሙሉ ስምን የሚተካ መስክ። (በWindows ላይ፦ displayname) "

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Email"
msgstr "ኢሜይል"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Field that will replace the Email taken from LDAP. (on windows: mail)"
msgstr "ከLDAP ተወስዶ ኢሜይልን የሚተካ መስክ። (በWindows ላይ፦ mail)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL Linking"
msgstr "የURL ማገናኘት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Server Base URL"
msgstr "የአገልጋይ መሠረታዊ URL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a the server location that will be used for links to the Cacti site. This should include the subdirectory if Cacti does not run from root folder."
msgstr "ይህ ወደ Cacti ድረ-ገጽ ለሚወስዱ አገናኞች ጥቅም ላይ የሚውለው የአገልጋይ መገኛ ነው። Cacti ከዋናው አቃፊ የማይሰራ ከሆነ ይህ ንዑስ አቃፊውን ማካተት አለበት."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "የኢሜይል አማራጮች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Notify Primary Admin of Issues"
msgstr "ዋና አስተዳዳሪን ስለ ችግሮች አሳውቅ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "In cases where the Cacti server is experiencing problems, should the Primary Administrator be notified by Email?  The Primary Administrator's Cacti user account is specified under the Authentication tab on Cacti's settings page. It defaults to the 'admin' account."
msgstr "የCacti አገልጋይ ችግሮች ባጋጠሙት ጊዜ፣ ዋናው አስተዳዳሪ በኢሜይል መነገር አለበት? የዋናው አስተዳዳሪ የCacti የተጠቃሚ መለያ በCacti ቅንብሮች ገጽ ላይ በማረጋገጫ ትር ስር ተገልጿል። በነባሪ ወደ 'admin' መለያ ያመለክታል."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Test Email"
msgstr "የሙከራ ኢሜይል"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is a Email account used for sending a test message to ensure everything is working properly."
msgstr "ይህ ሁሉም ነገር በትክክል እየሰራ መሆኑን ለማረጋገጥ የሙከራ መልእክት ለመላክ ጥቅም ላይ የሚውል የኢሜይል መለያ ነው."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Mail Services"
msgstr "የመልእክት አገልግሎቶች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which mail service to use in order to send mail"
msgstr "ኢሜይል ለመላክ የትኛው የመልእክት አገልግሎት ጥቅም ላይ መዋል እንዳለበት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Mail Server"
msgstr "የመልእክት አገልጋዩን Ping አድርግ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping the Mail Server before sending test Email?"
msgstr "የሙከራ ኢሜይል ከመላክ በፊት የመልእክት አገልጋዩን Ping ማድረግ?"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "የላኪ ኢሜይል አድራሻ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "ይህ ኢሜይሉ የተላከበት መስሎ የሚታየው የኢሜይል አድራሻ ነው."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html_reports.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "የላኪ ስም"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Email will appear from."
msgstr "ይህ ኢሜይሉ የተላከበት መስሎ የሚታየው ትክክለኛ ስም ነው."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Word Wrap"
msgstr "የቃላት መጠቅለያ (Word Wrap)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is how many characters will be allowed before a line in the Email is automatically word wrapped. (0 = Disabled)"
msgstr "ይህ በኢሜይሉ ውስጥ አንድ መስመር በራስ-ሰር ከመጠቅለሉ በፊት ምን ያህል ቁምፊዎች እንደሚፈቀዱ ነው። (0 = ቦዝኗል)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Sendmail Options"
msgstr "የSendmail አማራጮች"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/functions.php
msgid "Sendmail Path"
msgstr "የSendmail መንገድ (Path)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the path to sendmail on your server. (Only used if Sendmail is selected as the Mail Service)"
msgstr "ይህ በአገልጋይዎ ላይ ወደ sendmail የሚወስደው መንገድ ነው። (ጥቅም ላይ የሚውለው Sendmail እንደ መልእክት አገልግሎት ከተመረጠ ብቻ ነው)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Options"
msgstr "የSMTP አማራጮች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Hostname"
msgstr "የSMTP አስተናጋጅ ስም (Hostname)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is the hostname/IP of the SMTP Server you will send the Email to. For failover, separate your hosts using a semi-colon."
msgstr "ይህ ኢሜይሉን የሚልኩበት የSMTP አገልጋይ አስተናጋጅ ስም/IP ነው። ለመጠባበቂያ፣ አስተናጋጆችዎን በነጥብ-ሰረዝ ይለዩ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Port"
msgstr "የSMTP ወደብ (Port)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The port on the SMTP Server to use."
msgstr "ጥቅም ላይ የሚውለው በSMTP አገልጋይ ላይ ያለው ወደብ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Username"
msgstr "የSMTP የተጠቃሚ ስም"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The username to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "በSMTP በኩል ሲልኩ ለማረጋገጥ የሚያገለግል የተጠቃሚ ስም። (ማረጋገጫ የማይፈልጉ ከሆነ ባዶ ይተዉት።)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Password"
msgstr "የSMTP የይለፍ ቃል"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The password to authenticate with when sending via SMTP. (Leave blank if you do not require authentication.)"
msgstr "በSMTP በኩል ሲልኩ ለማረጋገጥ የሚያገለግል የይለፍ ቃል። (ማረጋገጫ የማይፈልጉ ከሆነ ባዶ ይተዉት።)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Security"
msgstr "የSMTP ደህንነት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The encryption method to use for the Email."
msgstr "ለኢሜይሉ ጥቅም ላይ የሚውለው የምስጠራ ዘዴ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SSL"
msgstr "SSL"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SMTP Timeout"
msgstr "የSMTP የጊዜ ማብቂያ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the SMTP timeout in seconds."
msgstr "እባክዎ የSMTP የጊዜ ማብቂያውን በሰከንዶች ውስጥ ያስገቡ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Reporting Presets"
msgstr "የሪፖርት ቅድመ-ቅንብሮች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Graph Image Format"
msgstr "ነባሪ የግራፍ ምስል ቅርጸት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When creating a new report, what image type should be used for the inline graphs."
msgstr "አዲስ ሪፖርት በሚፈጥሩበት ጊዜ ለውስጠ-መስመር ግራፎች የትኛው የምስል ዓይነት ጥቅም ላይ መዋል አለበት."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum E-Mail Size"
msgstr "ከፍተኛው የኢሜይል መጠን"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum size of the E-Mail message including all attachments."
msgstr "ሁሉንም አባሪዎች ጨምሮ የኢሜይል መልዕክቱ ከፍተኛ መጠን."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Logging Level for Cacti Reporting"
msgstr "ለCacti ሪፖርት ማድረጊያ የፖለር መዝገብ ደረጃ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file. WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "ወደ መዝገብ ፋይሉ እንዲላክ የሚፈልጉት የዝርዝር ደረጃ። ማስጠንቀቂያ፡ ከNONE ወይም LOW ውጭ በሆነ ሌላ ሁኔታ መተው የዲስክ ቦታዎን በፍጥነት ሊጨርስ ይችላል."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Lotus Notes (R) tweak"
msgstr "የLotus Notes (R) ማስተካከያን አንቃ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable code tweak for specific handling of Lotus Notes Mail Clients."
msgstr "የLotus Notes መልእክት ደንበኞችን (Mail Clients) በልዩ ሁኔታ ለማስተናገድ የኮድ ማስተካከያን አንቃ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Options"
msgstr "የDNS አማራጮች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "ዋና የDNS IP አድራሻ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the primary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "ለተገላቢጦሽ ፍለጋዎች ጥቅም ላይ የሚውለውን ዋና የDNS IP አድራሻ ያስገቡ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Secondary DNS IP Address"
msgstr "ሁለተኛ የDNS IP አድራሻ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the secondary DNS IP Address to utilize for reverse lookups."
msgstr "ለተገላቢጦሽ ፍለጋዎች ጥቅም ላይ የሚውለውን ሁለተኛ የDNS IP አድራሻ ያስገቡ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "የDNS ጊዜ ማብቂያ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds.  Cacti uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
msgstr "እባክዎ የDNS ጊዜ ማብቂያውን በሚሊሰከንዶች ያስገቡ። Cacti በPHP ላይ የተመሠረተ የDNS ፈቺ ይጠቀማል."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "በፍላጎት ላይ የRRD ማዘመኛ ቅንብሮች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "በፍላጎት ላይ የRRD ማዘመንን አንቃ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Boost በCacti ውስጥ በፍላጎት ላይ የRRD ማዘመንን ማንቃት አለበት? ካሰናከሉ ይህ ለውጥ ከሚቀጥለው የፖሊንግ ዑደት በኋላ እንጂ ተግባራዊ አይሆንም። የርቀት ውሂብ ሰብሳቢዎች ሲኖሩዎት ይህ ቅንብር መብራት አለበት."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "የስርዓት ደረጃ RRD አዘማኝ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "በፍላጎት ላይ ያለ የRRD ማዘመኛ ከመጽዳቱ በፊት የፖለር ሂደት ሁልጊዜ ማለፍ አለበት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Boost ሁሉንም RRDዎች በምን ያህል ድግግሞሽ ማዘመን አለበት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Boostን ሲያነቁ የRRD ፋይሎችዎ የሚዘመኑት በተጠቃሚ ሲጠየቁ ወይም ይህ የጊዜ ገደብ ሲያልፍ ብቻ ነው."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "የBoost ሂደቶች ብዛት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "በBoost ሰንጠረዥ ውስጥ ያሉትን ሁሉንም RRDዎች ለማስኬድ በአንድ ጊዜ የሚውሉ የBoost ሂደቶች ብዛት."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "ከፍተኛው የመዝገቦች ብዛት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "የBoost ውጤት ሰንጠረዥ በመዝገቦች ብዛት ከዚህ መጠን ከበለጠ ማዘመን ይከናወናል."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "በአንድ ክልል ውስጥ ያሉ የታለሙ የማህደር ረድፎች"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "የBoost አዘማኝ ሙሉ የአካባቢ ውሂብ መለያዎችን (Local Data IDs) በዚህ የረድፍ ብዛት አቅራቢያ ላሉ ተከታታይ ክልሎች ይመድባል። አንድ ነጠላ የአካባቢ ውሂብ መለያ በፍጹም ስለማይከፈል፣ አንድ ክልል ከታለመው መጠን ሊበልጥ ይችላል። የአዘማኙን ማህደረ ትውስታ እና የጥያቄ ጊዜ ለመቀነስ ይህን እሴት ይቀንሱ። ነባሪው እሴት 50000 ነው."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "ከፍተኛው የአርጉመንት ርዝመት"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Boost የማዘመኛ ትዕዛዞችን ወደ RRDtool ሲልክ ከስርዓተ ክወናው ከፍተኛው የአርጉመንት ርዝመት መብለጥ የለበትም። ይህ እንደ ስርዓተ ክወናው እና የከርነል ደረጃ ይለያያል። ለምሳሌ፡ Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ ያልተገደበ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "ለBoost እና ለፖለር የማህደረ ትውስታ ገደብ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "ለCacti ፖለር እና ለBoost ፖለር ከፍተኛው የማህደረ ትውስታ መጠን"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "ከፍተኛው የRRD ማዘመኛ ስክሪፕት መስሪያ ጊዜ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "የBoost ፖለር ከዚህ የመስሪያ ጊዜ ከበለጠ በCacti መዝገብ ውስጥ ማስጠንቀቂያ ይቀመጣል,"

#: include/global_settings.php
