msgstr "MySQL - ቅንብሮች"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "እነዚህ የ MySQL አፈጻጸም ማስተካከያ ቅንብሮች የ Cacti ስርዓትዎ ለረጅም ጊዜ ያለችግር በተሻለ ሁኔታ እንዲሰራ ያግዙታል."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "የሚመከሩ የ MySQL ስርዓት ተለዋዋጭ ቅንብሮች"

